# PageDesk's face kit: the bar, panel and card pictures (docs/PAGEDESK-SPEC.md
# 20.21.2). 16x16, one bit a pixel: '#' ink, '.' paper. The face draws each in
# a pen pair (black on grey, white on teal, white on black on a 1bpp display),
# so a picture is a SHAPE and never a colour.
#
#   icon <name>                the 16 rows follow
#   mirror <name> <of>         <of> reflected left to right
#
# tools/os88pdkit.py packs these, in this order, into PDRES's kit (kind 9) and
# names them PK_I_<NAME> in $(BUILD)/pdkit.h. Hand drawn after the owner's
# mockup (docs/pagedesk/design/vga-workspace.png); THE GRIDS ARE THE SOURCE.

